{"id": "fu_00", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_88349e29122f", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_f8ac6a136560", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "留存率是用户使用产品第1天后仍继续使用的比例，通常用来衡量产品粘性或用户满意度。", "summary": "ctr", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_cfc3b6407e73", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "付费率是用户点击后完成付费的比率，用于衡量素材吸引力。", "summary": "cpi", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_01", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_537a821d0ace", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_57d69a91a4b3", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "深度转化是指用户完成游戏内关键动作（如注册/充值/购买）后，仍在应用内持续游玩的倾向。ROAS_d7 是衡量它的重要指标。", "summary": "definition", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_5cf7e95732b3", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "浅层转化指用户在投放后24小时内安装或打开应用的行为。CPI 是衡量它常用的指标。", "summary": "definition", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_02", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_1b17159f68e5", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_cbc87f4b8f2b", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "有投放就叫「跑量」，未开始投或中途调停的不算。", "summary": "in_progress", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_92b3139f5328", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "可改投更低的 geotarget；或调整素材主题、开头钩子等视觉元素。", "summary": "geo_target", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_03", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_bf26ac618c02", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_401fb57972b6", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "CPM 是千次展示成本，通常用于衡量广告素材的投放效率。", "summary": "answered", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_495d05eaf3ff", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "CPC 是千次点击成本，用于衡量广告素材的点击效率。", "summary": "answered", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
