{"id": "fu_14", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_8b06c9602cb1", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_5fbbd6ef1473", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "素材衰退 = 创意疲劳，指区间内有足够样本但表现显著下滑。", "summary": "creative_fatigue", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_08d5a99af3e8", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "近期有素材衰退迹象，建议重点监控。", "summary": "creative_fatigue", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_15", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_11a740ba72f9", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_2337fad1b90e", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "防作弊是避免刷单/虚假安装的机制。有违规的素材会进入审核队列。", "summary": "policy_not_applicable", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_2a1d7d36e368", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "常见作弊手段包括：无人脸素材、过于简化的开头钩子、主色与受众色彩不匹配。可看 creative.get_asset_tags 确认。", "summary": "policy_not_applicable", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_16", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_8fa4e8b23877", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_07e753863b92", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "近期有3个campaign因频次过高被平台限制。", "summary": "restricted_3", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_7c06040be457", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "华东地区近期有48条素材，cpi_d7=2.1，低于安全线的2.6；华南只有9条，cpi_d7=2.6，刚好触碰上限。", "summary": "cpi_within_safety_line", "clarification": "", "tools": [{"tool": "analysis.geo_breakdown", "arguments": "{\"regions\": [\"华东\", \"华南\"], \"product_id\": \"GAME_PUZZLE\"}"}, {"tool": "benchmark.get_safety_line", "arguments": "{\"region\": \"华东\", \"product_id\": \"GAME_PUZZLE\"}"}], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_17", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_f8fba23f402a", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_7a7bdd1c309b", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "ROAS 是「广告花费回报率」，等于安装数除以支出。ROI 是「投资回报率」，等于（安装数×LTV）÷花费。您现在看的是 ROAS_d7（投放后 7 天的 ROAS）。", "summary": "answered", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_9f71e5f22033", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "ROAS是广告花费回报率，等于安装数除以支出。您看到的是投放后7天的ROAS。", "summary": "answered", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
